{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0333","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000039:text","row":44562,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「霧」","en":"“Kiri.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909068","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00001","en":"Taichi: \"Kiri.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000057:text","row":44563,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"全身が強ばる。","en":"My entire body went rigid.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909069","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00002","en":"Her entire body stiffens.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:0000007d:text","row":44564,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"ゆっくりと振り向く。","en":"I turned slowly.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909070","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00003","en":"Slowly she turns to face.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:0000018c:text","row":44565,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"振り返れば、厳めしい面差し","en":"A forbidding face awaited me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909071","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00004","en":"What looks back at me are unsparing features.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:000001c6:text","row":44566,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「おはよう」","en":"“Morning.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909072","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00005","en":"Taichi: \"'Morning.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:0000020d:text","row":44567,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「……何の用です？」","en":"“...What do you want?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909073","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00006","en":"Kiri: \"...what is your business?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000239:text","row":44568,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"低い声。","en":"Her voice was low.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909074","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00007","en":"A low voice.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000261:text","row":44569,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"「美希君はいないのかな？」","en":"“Miki isn’t here?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909075","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00008","en":"Taichi: \"Miki-kun's not around I guess?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:000002b6:text","row":44570,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「……いません」","en":"“...She isn’t.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909076","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00009","en":"Taichi: \"...she is not here.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["name_address","presentation"],"assessment":"The authoritative source identifies Kiri as the speaker answering Taichi. The English incorrectly labels Taichi as answering his own question.","remedy":"Kiri: \"...she is not here.\"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":29,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"...she is not here.\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:000002e6:text","row":44571,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909077","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00010","en":"Taichi: \"Right.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000308:text","row":44572,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"知っている。","en":"I knew that.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909078","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00011","en":"I knew it.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000334:text","row":44573,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「商店街の方でうろうろしてた。情緒不安定な感じだったよ」","en":"“She was wandering around the shopping district. She looked pretty shaken.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909079","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00012","en":"Taichi: \"She was wandering aimlessly about the shopping district. It felt like she was emotionally unstable.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:000003a7:text","row":44574,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「美希が……？」","en":"“Miki was...?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909080","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00013","en":"Kiri: \"Miki's...?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:000003d7:text","row":44575,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「行ってあげたら？」","en":"“Why don’t you go find her?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909081","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00014","en":"Taichi: \"Could you go?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:000004d4:text","row":44576,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"霧は応じることもなく、教室を飛び出した。","en":"Without a word, Kiri bolted from the classroom.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909082","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00015","en":"Kiri flies out of the classroom without any other response.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:0000051c:text","row":44577,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「おい、これ」","en":"“Hey, take this.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909083","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00016","en":"Taichi: \"Heeey, have this!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:000005c6:text","row":44578,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「……な？」","en":"“...Huh?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909084","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00017","en":"Kiri: \"...wha-?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:000005f2:text","row":44579,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「昼飯。美希にあげる約束してたやつ」","en":"“Lunch. I promised Miki I’d give it to her.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909085","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00018","en":"Taichi: \"Lunch. It's what I promised Miki I'd give her.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:0000062e:text","row":44580,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"嘘。","en":"A lie.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909086","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00019","en":"Lies.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:0000064a:text","row":44581,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"でもこう言わないと霧は受け取らない。","en":"But Kiri would never take it otherwise.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909087","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00020","en":"But without telling her that, Kiri would never accept it.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:0000070a:text","row":44582,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「……どうして、あなたが……」","en":"“...Why would you...?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909088","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00021","en":"Kiri: \"...why are you...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000748:text","row":44583,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「ほら、急げよ。泣いてたぞ」","en":"“Go on, hurry. She was crying.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909089","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00022","en":"Taichi: \"Come on, hurry it up! She was crying you know.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000852:text","row":44584,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"訝しげに俺を一瞥し、霧は走り去った。","en":"Kiri shot me a doubtful glance, then ran off.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909090","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00023","en":"Kiri gave one single quizzical look at me, then ran away.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:0000088e:text","row":44585,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"よし、これでいい。","en":"Good. That would do.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909091","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00024","en":"Good, we're fine this is fine.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:000008b8:text","row":44586,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"大きく息をついた。","en":"I let out a long breath.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909092","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00025","en":"I let out a big sigh.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:000009c1:text","row":44587,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"霧とのこと、一日は時間を置かねばならないだろう。","en":"I would have to give Kiri a day to cool off.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909093","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00026","en":"I expect that I will have to allot time for Kiri every single day.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["tense_aspect","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The narrator says he should leave one day before dealing with Kiri. The English instead says he must devote time to her on every day.","remedy":"I should leave a day before dealing with Kiri.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":65,"start":29,"text":"allot time for Kiri every single day"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000a09:text","row":44588,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"日曜、世界は巻き戻される。","en":"On Sunday, the world would rewind.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909094","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00027","en":"On Sunday, the world will be rewound.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000a3b:text","row":44589,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"ご破算の日。","en":"The day everything was wiped clean.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909095","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00028","en":"The day of the fresh start.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000a5f:text","row":44590,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"今の世界は理想郷かも知れない。","en":"Perhaps this world was a utopia.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909096","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00029","en":"The world as it is now could be my Utopia, perhaps.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000a95:text","row":44591,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"致命傷が、致命とならない世界。","en":"A world where a mortal wound did not kill.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909097","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00030","en":"A world where a mortal wound is not fatal.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000acb:text","row":44592,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"一週間で元通り。","en":"Everything back to normal in a week.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909098","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00031","en":"All back to what it was after one week.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000af3:text","row":44593,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"誰を傷つけても、誰と共依存しても。","en":"No matter who I hurt or entered into codependence with.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909099","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00032","en":"Whoever I might wound, whoever I might co-depend on.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000b2d:text","row":44594,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"リセット。","en":"Reset.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909100","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00033","en":"Reset.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000b4f:text","row":44595,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"冬子と仲良くしたら次はみみ先輩と。","en":"Touko one week, then Mimi the next.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909101","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00034","en":"If I get on good terms with Touko, next will be with Mimi-senpai.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000b89:text","row":44596,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"霧と。","en":"Kiri.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909102","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00035","en":"And Kiri.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000ba7:text","row":44597,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"美希と。","en":"Miki.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909103","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00036","en":"And Miki.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000bc7:text","row":44598,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"気が向いたら曜子ちゃんと。","en":"Youko, if the mood struck me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909104","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00037","en":"And Youko-chan, if I feel inclined to.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000bf9:text","row":44599,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"桜庭と。","en":"Sakuraba.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909105","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00038","en":"And Sakuraba.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000c19:text","row":44600,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"……それはない。","en":"...No. Not that.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909106","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00039","en":"...that's not gonna happen.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000c41:text","row":44601,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"だけど。","en":"But.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909107","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00040","en":"However,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000c61:text","row":44602,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"可能性がそこにあり、リセットから免れている場所がある。","en":"There was a place where possibility remained, untouched by the reset.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909108","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00041","en":"there are possibilities there, for there is a place that is exempt from the reset.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000caf:text","row":44603,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"完璧なご都合主義ではない。","en":"It was not perfect wish fulfillment.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909109","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00042","en":"This isn't complete opportunism.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000ce1:text","row":44604,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"だから俺は―――","en":"And so I—","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909110","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00043","en":"Therefore I---","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000e82:text","row":44605,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"去年の初夏だった。","en":"It was early summer last year.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909111","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00044","en":"It was last year, early Summer,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000eac:text","row":44606,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"新川豊と出会ったのは。","en":"That was when I met Yutaka Shinkawa.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909112","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00045","en":"when I had my meeting with Shinkawa Yutaka.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000eda:text","row":44607,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"蝉のうるさい夏だった。","en":"A summer loud with cicadas.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909113","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00046","en":"It was a Summer of loud cicadas.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000f8e:text","row":44608,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"『ＯＫ、なんとかやっていけそうな気がしてきた』","en":"‘Okay. I’m starting to think I can make this work.’","speakerJa":"新川","speakerEn":"Shinkawa","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909114","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00047","en":"Shinkawa: 『Okieh, I got the feeling I can work with this somehow.』","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00000fdc:text","row":44609,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“........................”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909115","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00048","en":"Taichi: \"......\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00001000:text","row":44610,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"悪かったのは誰か。","en":"Who was to blame?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909116","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00049","en":"Who was at fault?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:0000102a:text","row":44611,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"運命や巡り合わせのせいには、できない。","en":"I could not blame fate or circumstance.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909117","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00050","en":"I cannot blame fate nor coincidence.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:00001068:text","row":44612,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"誰かが悪い。あるいは、誰もが悪い。","en":"Someone was at fault. Or everyone was.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909118","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00051","en":"Either was at fault. Or possibly, we all were at fault.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["omission","grammar"],"assessment":"The Japanese says someone was at fault, or perhaps everyone was. The English omits 'someone,' leaving 'either' without alternatives.","remedy":"Someone was at fault.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":19,"start":0,"text":"Either was at fault"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0333:000010a2:text","row":44613,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"それを認められれば、結論はそう多くない。","en":"If I could admit that, there were not many conclusions left to draw.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:909119","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd3002b:00052","en":"Once that is conceded, the conclusions aren't that many.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
